    "body": "For the clients that don't get to http fetch, the following steps set the value:\r\n\r\n> set <var>settings object</var>'s <span data-x=\"concept-environment-active-service-worker\">active service worker</span> to <span>creator browsing context</span>'s <span>active document</span>'s <span>relevant settings object</span>'s <span data-x=\"concept-environment-active-service-worker\">active service worker</span>.\r\n\r\nand for the clients that get through http fetch, the following steps set the value:\r\n\r\n> , and <var>settings object</var>'s <span data-x=\"concept-environment-active-service-worker\">active service worker</span> to <var>reserved environment</var>'s <span\r\n     data-x=\"concept-environment-active-service-worker\">active service worker</span>.\r\n\r\nthe reserved client's active service worker here is set in Handle Fetch where the registration matching is done.",
